{"id":"campion-laura","label":"Thomas Campion: Rose-cheeked Laura","blocks":[{"k":"v","lines":["Rose-cheek’d Laura, come;","Sing thou smoothly with thy beauty’s","Silent music, either other","Sweetly gracing."]},{"k":"v","lines":["Lovely forms do flow","From concent divinely framèd:","Heaven is music, and thy beauty’s","Birth is heavenly."]},{"k":"v","lines":["These dull notes we sing","Discords need for helps to grace them;","Only beauty purely loving","Knows no discord;"]},{"k":"v","lines":["But still moves delight,","Like clear springs renew’d by flowing,","Ever perfect, ever in them-","selves eternal."]}]}